      "en": "Judas then, having taken a detachment of soldiers and officers from the chief priests and the Pharisees, came there with lanterns, torches, and weapons.",
      "ko": "유다가 군대와 및 대제사장들과 바리새인들에게서 얻은 하속들을 데리고 등과 홰와 병기를 가지고 그리로 오는지라",
      "source_text_hash": "69185a3fa01b16c77ec643a13b484b84e1e95f8c167abf4f211eb3e1a9ec1ebc",
      "translation_text_hash": "81dca470953129646db61bde9d83302d21b17f50480a0cd0e4d959bd5726508b",
