      "en": "They answered him, “Jesus of Nazareth.” Jesus said to them, “I am he.” Judas also, who betrayed him, was standing with them.",
      "ko": "대답하되 나사렛 예수라 하거늘 가라사대 내로라 하시니라 그를 파는 유다도 저희와 함께 섰더라",
      "source_text_hash": "11f3af4ae88a193cdd3b8b51ad0ede271246162ef8e4d80b014a4bfdc4f556fb",
      "translation_text_hash": "85b23d876c8de1fecfef427976f1d965c03e26a8ab8f32728ed0ed913801efea",
