      "en": "Now the servants and the officers were standing there, having made a fire of coals, for it was cold. They were warming themselves. Peter was with them, standing and warming himself.",
      "ko": "그 때가 추운고로 종과 하속들이 숯불을 피우고 서서 쬐니 베드로도 함께 서서 쬐더라",
      "source_text_hash": "99841902c636b3dc1ced8c5ebdc0fce890caa47b426d4b7b93355a875c2e26fb",
      "translation_text_hash": "e75cfd3af8dbc946988e37197ea8127417c58d72f40840f4075dc2d10c7fbb93",
