      "en": "Why do you ask me? Ask those who have heard me what I said to them. Behold, they know the things which I said.”",
      "ko": "어찌하여 내게 묻느냐 내가 무슨 말을 하였는지 들은 자들에게 물어 보라 저희가 나의 하던 말을 아느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "20cb97661fc5da14dbcaca8e4966331a0802d452719db36aea69ae67ce3961d9",
      "translation_text_hash": "55aceb78dfa19890dfd0be93c42cfb7977ca2ab5fc1ac04fd0bf7c782b481fa8",
