      "en": "When he had said this, one of the officers standing by slapped Jesus with his hand, saying, “Do you answer the high priest like that?”",
      "ko": "이 말씀을 하시매 곁에 섰는 하속 하나가 손으로 예수를 쳐 가로되 네가 대제사장에게 이 같이 대답하느냐 하니",
      "source_text_hash": "e502008d85d035e2863ea7a59b9ab66a6051fbf3674fcb175c17b25e2fa81f08",
      "translation_text_hash": "19ea7080406a80ffc27e9b4b3cad32c8f8fde56c864535b998e12f4843485e20",
