      "en": "Pilate therefore said to them, “Take him yourselves, and judge him according to your law.” Therefore the Jews said to him, “It is illegal for us to put anyone to death,”",
      "ko": "빌라도가 가로되 너희가 저를 데려다가 너희 법대로 재판하라 유대인들이 가로되 우리에게는 사람을 죽이는 권이 없나이다 하니",
      "source_text_hash": "eea34ead0631e18befbd8bc481c781c4b30cc8b4699cc9531011a526dc8a0b46",
      "translation_text_hash": "1897f06e3b3b03ab9ea4031ad0246104d21108297ec87b27bf62393190f8bc19",
